minor type="added" "Screen sharing on iOS 27+ now captures in-process via ScreenCaptureKit, selecting content through the system picker with no Broadcast Upload Extension or app group. Enabling screen share waits for the user's selection and throws if they dismiss the picker, so no empty track is published, and stopping the share from system UI unpublishes the track. Set the new `ScreenShareCaptureOptions.useScreenCaptureKit` to `false` to keep the ReplayKit paths on iOS 27"
